              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "jiàoxun — \"hard lesson learned\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "wǒ juéde zhè shì yí ge hěn hǎo de jiàoxun — I think that's a good lesson to learn."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Its characters come later; for now it is a word for the ear."
